&lt;p&gt;We are now looking for an experienced&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Talent Acquisition Partner&lt;/strong&gt; with a background hiring technical customer facing roles for a technology company.&amp;nbsp; This position offers the chance to directly influence our success, in a fast-scaling, international environment.&lt;/p&gt;
