&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Lead Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Patient Profile&lt;/strong&gt; team in the &lt;strong&gt;Patient&lt;/strong&gt; domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to make the patient health record complete, accurate and current enough that everything else we build can act on it, the health recommendations, care plans and assistant experiences that help people take their health into their own hands. You will work in a feature team developing the Patient Health Record, health trackers, patient account and online identity, contributing directly to &lt;strong&gt;the quality of the medical support we provide to both patients and practitioners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A patient record is built from four channels: what patients enter themselves, what they share when preparing a consultation, what we retrieve from health professionals&#39; systems, and what they connect from third-party sources such as Apple Health, Google Health Connect and national health record services. Three of those channels belong to teams you will not manage. You will own the outcome across all four, the most leveraged place to sit in a health platform, and only reachable through other people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also work inside a hard regulatory perimeter: health data, GDPR, consent by design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
